[{"client_msg_id":"71066c38-fe43-4cd3-91e7-169c8eaea947","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"なるほど","ts":"1634309745.416300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MrDAV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78a052ab-d070-4f27-9527-f69a473525eb","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"os.StartProcessの第三引数に SysProcAttr.Cmdline を含む構造体を渡せば、ライブラリの連結処理を使わず、生コマンドラインを直接指定できるというやつ、実際に使ってます、nyagosで","ts":"1634309735.416100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TbfTV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2d39ae3-7ef4-4b3b-822b-73b1fb9bc51a","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"あ、それ、使ってます","ts":"1634309608.414000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IGSV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d2cf6e9-4bc0-484f-b2f7-10b7ce986e73","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"なるほど","ts":"1634309581.413800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s/s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7b2c0b6-4ba4-402b-be43-9a46fe9920a7","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"```\t// SysProcAttr holds optional, operating system-specific attributes.\n\t// Run passes it to os.StartProcess as the os.ProcAttr's Sys field.\n\tSysProcAttr *syscall.SysProcAttr```","ts":"1634309573.413500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k6ffi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4cb257f-a3e4-43c2-86c3-4bf3e9a73612","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"```SysProcAttr.CmdLine```\nってのがあったのか","ts":"1634309532.412900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qS4k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1759f8a6-df61-4c0f-b097-7a165ac13b24","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"```// On Windows, processes receive the whole command line as a single string\n// and do their own parsing. Command combines and quotes Args into a command\n// line string with an algorithm compatible with applications using\n// CommandLineToArgvW (which is the most common way). Notable exceptions are\n// msiexec.exe and cmd.exe (and thus, all batch files), which have a different\n// unquoting algorithm. In these or other similar cases, you can do the\n// quoting yourself and provide the full command line in SysProcAttr.CmdLine,\n// leaving Args empty.```","ts":"1634309490.412700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pAB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"150ecd43-4445-42c6-b797-c82ac8c9649f","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"CommandLineToArgvW?","ts":"1634309295.412300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+PQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9ba2d65-1e43-43b2-a88b-bb44e90672c8","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"というか文字列化する API は確かない。","ts":"1634309253.411900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vc0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f9c0021-9d17-4491-a6e4-ed44f17af8d9","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ほほう","ts":"1634309250.411800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zSx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2ab0b4a-32b7-4e5e-bee8-9a6931c802b7","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"パースは GetCommandLineArgs 使ってたと思います。文字列化するのは独自で頑張ってたはず。","ts":"1634309241.411300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h4B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6182948-34ef-41b8-afdf-1f88e9925969","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Go は全部独自で頑張ってるんでしょうか","ts":"1634309177.410400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vDSX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df1c428a-5c25-4836-9fe0-7e67da701c6b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"msvcrt と mingw の libcrt でも違うという。","ts":"1634309153.410100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Eae"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d439fcb-e635-4486-bde4-1ecc5e550cd9","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"何も期待できない","ts":"1634309124.409400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0/BR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de304099-e5cb-4abc-bc47-7b53ba0621e7","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"プロセス自身がワイルドカードを展開してて、さらにランタイムで挙動が違うので本当に闇。","ts":"1634309117.409200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7O/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c4b804e-15ac-4297-a0af-5b2ec91d71de","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"いやーこれは色々と厳しい","ts":"1634309112.409000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WG25b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e076fefe-de33-49d3-ba54-e32f23330276","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"これは良い資料ですね。もっと早くめぐりあいたかった…（ガクッ…絶命）","ts":"1634309102.408600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"floKb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5621f94c-8726-4d2a-bfc1-8a58d14014e9","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"VC++ のランタイムのバージョンによっても挙動が違うんですね","ts":"1634309072.408000","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1634309082.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N7Ld"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a617c6f-f446-464c-840a-66fca6e6ba0c","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"hahaha...","ts":"1634308927.406900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EleF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"160b5858-4873-4a91-9c42-bd888a811a02","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"haha","ts":"1634308907.406400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rkaZa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b31a8834-7ccc-4f0d-a6a4-4aac9d5991ac","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u0026gt; 4.  Everyone Parses Differently\n\u0026gt; You'll get different results if you pass a command line to ShowParams.exe (written in C/C++), ShowParams.vbs (VBScript), or ShowParams.bat (batch file):","ts":"1634308905.406200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k2e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60486eea-b806-4a68-9900-17c80b93aa0a","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"```exec.Command(\"find.exe\",`\"KEYWORD\" *.go`)```\nですね。失礼","ts":"1634308822.405900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hKe4g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01d0531f-582f-4d02-8390-8c17ffd7f20e","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Unix は 3 ステップで終わるのに Windows は 15 ステップくらいあって地獄","ts":"1634308807.405600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EcB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3c3d030-6a3a-483a-8d2d-53dd049c2a37","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"間違えました。","ts":"1634308789.405000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Xc=c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae86a35c-758a-4c11-9aaa-fb0d07fec328","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"引数をくっつけた場合かな","ts":"1634308768.404700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yJt/3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91dcdd46-0bb8-42d9-9c0b-596c5ad00205","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"上がパースできませんが…","ts":"1634308752.404500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PjgQG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e1e4453-073b-4502-97ec-fc1862f8a67e","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"```exec.Command(\"find.exe\",`\"KEYWORD\"` *.go\")```\nとかしちゃうと\n```find.exe \"\\\"KEYWORD\\\" *.go\"```\n相当になっちゃいます","ts":"1634308693.404000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u1L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d160e5d6-65d0-42a2-ab45-4e613aaf63a2","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u003chttps://daviddeley.com/autohotkey/parameters/parameters.htm\u003e あった","ts":"1634308680.403900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o2tj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69498327-20fc-4ef0-baa4-db0c7bf6d20a","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"いや、exec.Command は UNIX をエミュレートしているので","ts":"1634308564.402200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1csU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e940ac52-bb41-4510-b041-a8677f0adeae","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"exec.Command にわたすのはそうすると一つの引数文字列でよいということになるんでしょうか","ts":"1634308507.401000","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1634308534.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CGOl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"122933fe-8063-43f3-b8c5-f3f5388dcd4b","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"DOS と Unix Shell の比較のページがあったけど失念してしまった","ts":"1634308395.399600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3zc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46fbc3de-8bb4-487a-95ef-ca76ec7847e4","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"Windows では呼び出し元プロセスでライブラリが文字列配列を１つの文字列へ連結して CreateProcess APIに引き渡し、呼び出されるプロセスでは受け取った１つの文字列を分割して元の文字列配列を再生しようとするという壮大な無駄","ts":"1634308337.398900","edited":{"user":"UGHCXN79P","ts":"1634308373.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"URpQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b33f1ceb-1427-44ce-a547-067d5adbd560","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"exec にどう渡すかは難しくはないですね","ts":"1634308242.398500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gfWXP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90ca8267-26ff-4349-aee8-3e0d65039d9a","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Unix はとにかくスペースで区切られた文字の配列なので","ts":"1634308223.397600","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1634308233.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z21nn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dcff9a74-d2fb-4f9a-8a36-46351b547a94","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、とはいえunixのコマンドも引数が磐石でもないし、正直引数という概念つらい...","ts":"1634308087.395200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SDJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f22730de-aa10-4bda-b007-2a933664b253","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"UNIX ではプロセスの引数は文字列の配列ですが、Windows では一枚板の１個の文字列なので","ts":"1634307987.394500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lm="}]},{"client_msg_id":"25f4755a-05a2-4878-9ba5-7e79c28056bb","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"レイヤーがなんかめちゃくちゃになっているようにみえますね…","ts":"1634307938.393300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B95F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8eb24fb-b48d-4f32-b161-5b55503c5aab","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"はい、find.exe は「二重引用符で囲まれたパラメータ」を検索キーワードとして解釈するという妙な仕様がありまして","ts":"1634307912.392800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LCVqi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e98cd234-fe50-416e-98a3-755ba88adebe","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"なるほど \u0026gt; 展開しません","ts":"1634307877.392300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t4blo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1381fc2c-1b7b-4abe-aea3-dde064d47b8f","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"意味がかわってしまう?","ts":"1634307869.391800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KgP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3925ce8-1d92-44bd-8d49-906eec2671f3","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"`\"KEYWORD\"` わたすなら `KEYWORD` でわたすのではないんでしょうか","ts":"1634307861.391400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wyK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"196ef036-97e4-48cc-8a94-bde3867f30f4","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"Windows(CMD.EXE) は展開しません。","ts":"1634307845.390900","edited":{"user":"UGHCXN79P","ts":"1634307861.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6WIl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a94e2457-b89f-432d-8d7a-9af2df7b5f5c","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"というのと","ts":"1634307836.390500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iAO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba12381c-568b-43dd-9377-73fb7e4a815c","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"`*` ってシェルが展開するんじゃないんですっっけ","ts":"1634307833.390300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PB6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"485357db-f159-4d93-9faa-c77697009041","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なるほど...","ts":"1634307286.384500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZuQY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1fd56233-df03-4ee2-a6a5-1b3e10619797","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"`find \"KEYWORD\" *.go` 相当のことをしたい時に\n```exec.Command(\"find.exe\",`\"KEYWORD\"`,\"*.go\")```\nとかすると\n```find.exe \\\"KEYWORD\\\" *.go```\nみたいなことになってしまう問題がありまして…\n（ちょっと説明が難しい…）","ts":"1634307238.383800","edited":{"user":"UGHCXN79P","ts":"1634307259.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"==oK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bff6533-069b-4e4b-8cc6-011026f0ec9d","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"「意図通り」ってのは DOS コマンドそのままでって意味でしょうか","ts":"1634306361.374100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LbON="}]},{"client_msg_id":"4230b035-7b6e-430f-8a5a-5f8c0a80face","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"最近、簡単に C言語のsystem関数っぽいことやりたいけど、二重引用符は意図どおり渡したかった時：\n```os.Setenv(\"CMDLINE\", cmdline) \ncmd := exec.Command(\"cmd.exe\", \"/S\", \"/C\", \"%CMDLINE%\")```\nで逃げました (※ nyagosでこんな雑なことはせず、 os.StartProcess 関数の第三引数をゴニョゴニョしてました )","ts":"1634304491.372400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8g8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b737b55-4031-4492-b5d6-1f5f6e45979b","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"DOS のエスケープルールが尋常じゃなく複雑だった記憶があります","ts":"1634298748.367500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h6Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"299436b8-1817-45f9-bc86-123303339b48","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"exec.Command は渡したい文字列が分割された引数でそのまま渡るという点では良くできてる(まさか配列がもう一度文字列になってるとは思えないほどに)けど、逆にシェルに渡す引数のつもりで書くと失敗しがち。","ts":"1634295635.366500","edited":{"user":"U03C6TEAZ","ts":"1634295688.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QVK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af0eca70-6a4d-44d7-b92e-1bd25fda6b61","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そろそろ \u003c#C012HHBHWUR|tech-db\u003e かもだけど、Windowsもドメインソケット入ったのに対して、PostgreSQLはサポートしてるんだろうか?","ts":"1634291504.362700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c564y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0dd7959-2f25-455a-b101-4c0fc1b59e6a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"↑のはUNIXドメインソケット使いたくない、というか /var/run/postgresql のパーミッションを必要とさせたくないって話でした。そもそもWindowsならデフォでドメインソケット開かない(もしくはパーミッションを明示する必要ない)ので `-k` を追加すること自体が無駄でした。","ts":"1634291364.361700","thread_ts":"1634291364.361700","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1634291408.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UGHCXN79P"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CAys"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fac7ced-dce6-464f-a43a-a8b20aea59e4","type":"message","user":"UGHCXN79P","text":"Windows の \"os/exec\" の Command は二重引用符の扱いがめんどくさくて、普通に \" を渡すと \\\" とかにコンバートされたりして、なかなか期待どおりに渡せなかったりしますね","ts":"1634291191.357200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"honsore","count":2,"users":["U06BRP8VD","U023TTSQ87P"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"==A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f08ab24-b3b2-4304-a045-7dfc3812c3c9","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ちなみに使ってるのがコレ \u003chttps://github.com/koron-go/pgctl\u003e","ts":"1634291161.356100","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"koron-go/pgctl","id":1,"title":"koron-go/pgctl","text":"pg_ctl command wrapper for golang","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"1","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Go","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6WFlA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18dd08c6-e23d-41d6-a3b0-21a2b623cbe7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なるほど… UNIXで動かすときにドメインソケットを無効化するための設定が `-o \"-k ''\"` で、それがWindowsでは悪さをすると…","ts":"1634290419.354800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mDzn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9e0411e-dfb7-4fa8-88b9-c514511260ad","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"これかもしれん","ts":"1634290181.354100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"goS4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13b5d9f5-db8c-4728-8380-057330a9de28","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あああああ `-o \"-k ''\"` が付いてた","ts":"1634290176.353900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oZr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e504422-84b9-4adc-bb63-6280fd6b61d4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なにが違うんやろか。","ts":"1634290011.353400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dcip"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06e738a1-c063-49c2-ba9e-91e30c0f2f93","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"4001 は指定しているポート番号だからあんま関係ないんだけど","ts":"1634290004.353100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z01"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aeb0743c-d0f7-42a8-af64-be99ff5cd202","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Windowsで `pg_ctl start` を、コマンドラインから実行したら成功するけど、Goの `exec.CommandContext` から実行すると `FATAL:  could not create lock file \"''/.s.PGSQL.4001.lock\": No such file or directory` で失敗するの…なんでなん?","ts":"1634289971.352700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q3U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d943257c-6c26-4f82-9b7c-43e62da62721","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"おおおおお","ts":"1634256600.351300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kda"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4bfc433-ddef-4172-b2c3-1fa7962a32d9","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"log.SetFlagsですかね\n\u003chttps://pkg.go.dev/log@go1.17.2#pkg-constants|https://pkg.go.dev/log@go1.17.2#pkg-constants\u003e","ts":"1634256248.350900","attachments":[{"fallback":"log package - log - pkg.go.dev","id":1,"title":"log package - log - pkg.go.dev","title_link":"https://pkg.go.dev/log@go1.17.2#pkg-constants","text":"Package log implements a simple logging package.","blocks":null,"service_name":"pkg.go.dev","service_icon":"https://pkg.go.dev/static/shared/icon/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://pkg.go.dev/log@go1.17.2#pkg-constants","original_url":"https://pkg.go.dev/log@go1.17.2#pkg-constants"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pKIhu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbcc4094-6e28-47f6-87a6-017d67ee724b","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"goでlog.Fatalfするときに行番号とファイル名も出してほしくなってきた","ts":"1634250973.350000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z2Sm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71dd0363-245e-493b-8f26-c029b509ee8d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`/var/run/postgresql` になってんのはDebian向けのデフォルトなのかもな。PostgreSQLは `/tmp` をサンプルに書いてた。","ts":"1634292660.362900","thread_ts":"1634291364.361700","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lkkX"}]}]
